                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-2">

                        <strong>Cube:</strong>

                        <br>

                        Create a lambda function that returns the cube of a given number.

                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-2">

                        <strong>Addition:</strong>

                        <br>

                        Create a lambda function to add two numbers.

                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-2">

                        <strong>Even Numbers:</strong>

                        <br>

